{"id":"2K","title":"Blasphemy","part":{"n":2,"title":"Relationship to God"},"url":"/law/02-relationship-to-god/2k","entries":[{"id":"2K.1","text":"You are not to take the name of God in vain.","refs":[{"book":"Exodus","chapter":20,"verses":"7"},{"book":"Deuteronomy","chapter":5,"verses":"11"}],"citation":"Exod. 20:7; Deut. 5:11."},{"id":"2K.2","text":"Cursing or blasphemy against God forbidden.","refs":[{"book":"Colossians","chapter":3,"verses":"8"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":18,"verses":"21"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":19,"verses":"12"},{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":24,"verses":"15-16"},{"book":"Psalms","chapter":109,"verses":"17-18"}],"citation":"Col. 3:8; Lev. 18:21; Lev. 19:12; Lev. 24:15-16; Psa. 109:17-18."},{"id":"2K.3","text":"We should give no occasion for blasphemy to occur.","refs":[{"book":"2 Samuel","chapter":12,"verses":"14"},{"book":"1 Timothy","chapter":6,"verses":"1"}],"citation":"2 Sam. 12:14; 1 Tim. 6: 1."},{"id":"2K.4","text":"Blasphemy against the Holy Spirit never to be forgiven.","refs":[{"book":"Matthew","chapter":12,"verses":"31-32"},{"book":"Mark","chapter":3,"verses":"29"},{"book":"Luke","chapter":12,"verses":"10"}],"citation":"Matt. 12: 31-32; Mark 3:29; Luke 12:10."},{"id":"2K.5","text":"Whoever blasphemes the name of the LORD shall surely be put to death.","refs":[{"book":"Leviticus","chapter":24,"verses":"16,23"},{"book":"1 Kings","chapter":21,"verses":"10,13"}],"citation":"Lev. 24:16, 23; 1 Kings 21:10,13."},{"id":"2K.6","text":"Pray to keep yourself from profaning God's name.","refs":[{"book":"Proverbs","chapter":30,"verses":"9"}],"citation":"Prov. 30:9."},{"id":"2K.7","text":"One blasphemes the name of God by breaking the law which he preaches others to keep.","refs":[{"book":"Romans","chapter":2,"verses":"21-24"}],"citation":"Rom. 2:21-24."},{"id":"2K.8","text":"The nation suffers from swearing.","refs":[{"book":"Jeremiah","chapter":23,"verses":"10"},{"book":"Hosea","chapter":4,"verses":"2-3"}],"citation":"Jer. 23:10; Hos. 4:2-3."},{"id":"2K.9","text":"It is a foolish people who blaspheme God's name.","refs":[{"book":"Psalms","chapter":74,"verses":"18"}],"citation":"Psa. 74:18."}]}